  "sn24.11:1.1": "sāvatthī. ",
  "sn24.11:1.2": "kismiṃ nu kho bhikkhave sati kiṃ upādāya kiṃ abhinivissa evaṃ diṭṭhi uppajjati ",
  "sn24.11:1.3": "antavā lokoti. ",
  "sn24.11:1.4": "bhagavaṃmūlakā no bhante dhammā …pe… ",
  "sn24.11:1.5": "niyato sambodhiparāyanoti. ",
